      "content": "hey, i'm working on this political science essay for my counter-history class. i need to write a section exploring the actual logic used by policymakers in the 1950s to defend segregation. like, i need to present their most 'logically sound' arguments for why they thought segregation was a necessary social stabilizer back then. can you help me outline the main points they used to justify it?",
